h all the true rules of cricket, which gives you the freedom to explore the island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini Games: Break from the cricket a bit to do mini challenges like the bonfire dance-offs, yoga mat endurance challenge and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786330/extras/724b7540995cd127b4ac5666943fec8f.poster.avif?t=1786391881\" width=400 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786330/extras/724b7540995cd127b4ac5666943fec8f.webm?t=1786391881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786330/extras/724b7540995cd127b4ac5666943fec8f.mp4?t=1786391881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain Popularity: By doing different activities or playing cricket you can gain fame, which in turn will have its benefits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open Island Gameplay: Fool around on the beach and discover ways to upgrade your character and even improvise your way to victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Progression: Upgrade your character`s different stats and abilities, hair color and bikini colors.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Bikini Island Cricket blends the competitive thrill of cricket with the carefree joy of island life. It’s a game where skill meets silliness and where players are free to experiment, laugh, and create their own stories.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4786330/extras/ab255e74b72bf8aac528a87ed68d623e.avif?t=1786391881\"